5. setup cardDefs + cards registry: s.cardDefs['we-1'].damage === 10; s.cards['am-1#1'].cardId === 'am-1'; s.cards['ma-10#2'].cardId === 'ma-10'.
6. setup character assignment with explicit ids: players [{name:'A',characterCardId:'ch-2'},{name:'B',characterCardId:'ch-1'}] -> seats[0].characterInstanceId starts 'ch-2#', seats[1] starts 'ch-1#'; seats[0].hp 80, seats[1].hp 100.
